      "content": "thanks for the specific guidance, that's really helpful. i'll do it now. \n\nonce i've made the incision and it starts draining, should i use my fingers to firmly squeeze the area to make sure every bit of the sac or the material inside comes out? i'm worried that if i don't get it all, it'll just fill back up or cause a secondary infection inside the wound. i want to be thorough so it's definitely gone for good.",
